      "detailed_description": "<h1>数字豪华版</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《星球大战：银河赛车手™》豪华版包含以下内容：</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>三辆专享载具</strong>：驾驶 Kor Sarun: Ciza T 飞行摩托、Kor Sarun: Darc X 陆行艇和 Kor Sarun: Rak S 滑橇艇，成为赛场上的焦点！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>独特涂装</strong>，专为追求时尚风格的飞行员打造。用灵感源自纳布 N-1 星际战斗机的专享涂装，为你的飞行艇披上战袍。 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>三个街机模式活动</strong>，期待无畏的赛车手前来挑战。银河联赛发出挑战，邀请您参加专为您的 Kor Sarun 反重力飞船设计的三个专享街机模式试炼。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>豪华玩家横幅</strong>，内含适合多人游戏模式的专享徽章和背景。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>精美的数字艺术画册</strong>，展示了《星球大战：银河赛车手™》开发过程中从未公开过的角色、载具和场景艺术图。 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/5df4296a25dcf8ddf798765ed7ba2e57.avif?t=1791388584\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras_big/5df4296a25dcf8ddf798765ed7ba2e57.avif?t=1791388584 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《星球大战：银河赛车手™》是一款以竞速为核心的惊险赛车游戏，重新定义了赛车游戏的概念，以星球大战™星系的法外之地外环星域为游戏背景。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >帝国对银河系的统治终于瓦解，对速度的迷恋随之诞生。在新共和国艰难重建之际，赌博、娱乐和荣耀催生了一个日渐壮大的地下世界。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在这种混乱局面中，银河联赛诞生了：这是一个未经官方认可的赛车联盟，由各大财团赞助飞行员。短短几秒钟就能决定你会赚得盆满钵满，还是输得倾家荡产，只有勇敢者才能生存。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >没有原力，没有预言，只有技巧、策略和崛起的意志。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/12bc8baa79c89b768fa095a03a35b54e.poster.avif?t=1791388584\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/12bc8baa79c89b768fa095a03a35b54e.webm?t=1791388584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/a955f8455b266323b12c432681f25311.avif?t=1791388584\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras_big/a955f8455b266323b12c432681f25311.webp?t=1791388584 width=1560 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">驾驶陆行艇、飞行摩托、滑橇艇和飞梭赛车，在各种赛道上猛烈撞击、左冲右突、终结对手。风险越大，回报就越高。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/8d1c70d9471cd852d7bfc13723e43dc6.poster.avif?t=1791388584\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/8d1c70d9471cd852d7bfc13723e43dc6.webm?t=1791388584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/d09c13bec3cac3408516705974de40e9.avif?t=1791388584\" alt=\"在危险的地下运动中生存下来\" width=1560 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">加入银河联赛——一个诞生于法外之地外环星域的非官方赛车联盟。化身为孤胆飞行员幽影，追逐复仇与荣耀。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/f0989fffbab0d99c39b31a6458f8cb6f.poster.avif?t=1791388584\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/f0989fffbab0d99c39b31a6458f8cb6f.webm?t=1791388584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/e066256497a7c45b4ffbd80233dce1f1.avif?t=1791388584\" alt=\"打造并个性化你的飞行器\" width=1560 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">驾驶不同类型的反重力飞行器，每种飞行器都有其独特的物理特性和玩法。打造一款能够展现你个人风格并提供竞争优势的飞行器。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/5188f1be479ea154e53a8c1698be7cb4.poster.avif?t=1791388584\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/5188f1be479ea154e53a8c1698be7cb4.webm?t=1791388584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/117774a664067af636619728ed8f4ab9.avif?t=1791388584\" alt=\"在多种游戏模式中与对手展开激战\" width=1560 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">在剧情驱动的战役中独自驰骋，体验不断变化的联盟关系；或者勇敢地参与策略性的 PvP 复仇之战，一路建立声望。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/517eecff16529c0239ad434a299b71fd.poster.avif?t=1791388584\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/517eecff16529c0239ad434a299b71fd.webm?t=1791388584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/54d43d437eea6bb7736b524cf30c3498.avif?t=1791388584\" alt=\"提升等级，赢取奖励\" width=1560 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">在激烈的竞争和不断升级的挑战中证明自己。你的每一个选择都将影响你在银河联赛中的地位和前景。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/9f79c7b918871a8ba93a89d5bb2c6b67.poster.avif?t=1791388584\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078430/extras/9f79c7b918871a8ba93a89d5bb2c6b67.webm?t=1791388584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
